  "label": "Inspiration Porn",
  "description": "The meme uses the trope of 'inspiration porn' — portraying people with disabilities as inspirational or heartwarming subjects for the benefit of able-bodied viewers — to frame the woman's makeup application as a spectacle rather than a personal, empowering act. This trope trivializes the individual's dignity and reduces their experience to a narrative for others' consumption.",
